[215.428232, "o", "   - Exploitation probe: Nginx access log records HTTP GET/POST probes targetting OGNL / Struts endpoints `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:391`, `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:393`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[215.428325, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[215.428989, "o", "   - Dropped web shell: `/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:1` containing JNDI/LDAP lookup and OGNL expression payloads `/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:2`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[215.429017, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[215.429074, "o", "> "]
[215.429163, "o", "   - Vulnerability feed correlation: `/sas/vulns.json:4`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[215.429201, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[215.429238, "o", "> "]
[215.429252, "o", "\r\n"]
[215.429282, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[215.429332, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[215.429395, "o", "> "]
[215.4296, "o", "---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[215.429667, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
