[249.928051, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/remediation-plan.md\n# Remediation Plan & Reconciled Change Ticket\n\n## Executive Summary\nThis remediation plan outlines the containment, eradication, recovery, and verification steps required to remediate the compromise on `struts-prod-01` (`10.10.246.1`) `/disk/etc/hosts:2`. In accordance with forensic remediation rules, quarantine and backup procedures are prioritized over immediate deletion. The draft change ticket provided in `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md` has been reconciled against forensic disk evidence `/disk` and updated in place below.\n\n---\n\n## Reconciled Change Ticket (CHG-7100)\n\n| # | Action | Target | Status | Citation / Evidence Note |\n|---|--------|--------|--------|--------------------------|\n| 1 | Block source IP inbound at edge firewall | `198.51.100.167` | PROPOSED | **CORRECTED IP:** Replaced stale `203.0.113.9` with actual attacker IP `198.51.100.167` `/disk/var/log/secure:213`, `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:391`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5`. |\n| 2 | Patch Apache Struts2 OGNL RCE (`CVE-2023-50164`) | `/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar` | PROPOSED | **CORRECTED VULN:** Replaced incorrect BlueKeep `CVE-2019-0708` with `CVE-2023-50164` on Struts library `/disk/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:17`, `/sas/vulns.json:4`. |\n| 3 | Quarantine and remove malicious cron persistence | `/var/spool/cron/tomcat` | OPEN | **CORRECTED TARGET & STATUS:** Replaced `/var/spool/cron/root` (which was clean) with `/var/spool/cron/tomcat` `/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5`. Downgraded status from `DONE` to `OPEN`. |\n| 4 | Remove backdoor SSH public key & rotate keys | `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys` | PROPOSED | **ADDED SILENT PERSISTENCE:** Remove unauthorized key entry `/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:2` and rotate root SSH keys. |\n| 5 | Quarantine and remove dropped JSP web shell | `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp` | PROPOSED | **ADDED SILENT WEBSHELL:** Move web shell `/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:1` to secure quarantine and delete from web path. |\n| 6 | Quarantine and remove staged exfiltration dump | `/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz` | PROPOSED | **ADDED STAGED EXFIL:** Move staged database dump `/disk/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz:1` to quarantine directory. |\n| 7 | Secure anti-forensics artifact & enable central logging | `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` & `/var/log/secure` | PROPOSED | **ADDED ANTI-FORENSICS:** Secure wiping artifact `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` for evidence retention and configure remote append-only logging `/disk/var/log/secure:213`. |\n\n---\n\n## Step-by-Step Remediation Playbook\n\n### Phase 1: Containment\n1. **Network Isolation & Edge Blocking:**\n   - Block inbound/outbound communication with `198.51.100.167` at perimeter firewall `/disk/var/log/secure:213`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5`.\n   - Isolate host network interface temporarily during remediation.\n2. **Quarantine Web Shell & Staged Data:**\n   - Compress and move `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp` `/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:1` and `/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz` `/disk/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz:1` into an encrypted quarantine location outside the web root (e.g., `/root/quarantine/`).\n\n### Phase 2: Eradication\n1. **Persistence Removal:**\n   - Remove unauthorized public key from `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys` `/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:2`.\n   - Delete malicious cron entry in `/var/spool/cron/tomcat` `/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5`. Verify `/etc/crontab` `/disk/etc/crontab:2` remains limited to approved backup maintenance.\n2. **Credential Rotation:**\n   - Invalidate all active user sessions and rotate passwords/keys for `root`, `devops`, `webadmin`, `svc-backup`, and `postgres` `/disk/etc/passwd:1`.\n\n### Phase 3: Vulnerability Remediation & Hardening\n1. **Application Patching:**\n   - Upgrade `struts2-core.jar` `/disk/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar` to a secure version (e.g. >= 2.5.33 or >= 6.3.0.2) `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:19`.\n2. **File System Permissions Hardening:**\n   - Set `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/` to read-only for Tomcat user to prevent future web shell"]
[249.928083, "i", " drops `/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:1`.\n3. **Centralized Audit Logging:**\n   - Configure rsyslog/fluentd to ship `/var/log/secure` logs off-host to prevent unmonitored log wipes `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`, `/disk/var/log/secure:213`.\n\n### Phase 4: Verification & Monitoring\n1. Verify no active processes or connections remain to `198.51.100.167` `/disk/var/log/secure:213`.\n2. Run integrity scan on `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys` `/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:2` and `/var/spool/cron/` `/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5`.\n3. Confirm Tomcat service functions correctly with upgraded `struts2-core.jar` `/disk/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar`.\nEOF\n"]
