[249.933141, "o", "## Step-by-Step Remediation Playbook\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n"]
[249.933251, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[249.933264, "o", "### Phase 1: Containment\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 1. **Network Isolation & Edge Blocking:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[249.933435, "o", "   - Block inbound/outbound communication with `198.51.100.167` at perimeter firewall `/disk/var/log/secure:213`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[249.933551, "o", "   - Isolate host network interface temporarily during remediation.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[249.933619, "o", "2. **Quarantine Web Shell & Staged Data:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
