[249.934019, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> ### Phase 2: Eradication\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 1. **Persistence Removal:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[249.934148, "o", "   - Remove unauthorized public key from `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys` `/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:2`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[249.934335, "o", "   - Delete malicious cron entry in `/var/spool/cron/tomcat` `/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5`. Verify `/etc/crontab` `/disk/etc/crontab:2` remains limited to approved backup maintenance.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[249.934388, "o", "2. **Credential Rotation:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[249.934525, "o", "   - Invalidate all active user sessions and rotate passwords/keys for `root`, `devops`, `webadmin`, `svc-backup`, and `postgres` `/disk/etc/passwd:1`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[249.934627, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Phase 3: Vulnerability Remediation & Hardening\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[249.934691, "o", "1. **Application Patching:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[249.934907, "o", "   - Upgrade `struts2-core.jar` `/disk/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar` to a secure version (e.g. >= 2.5.33 or >= 6.3.0.2) `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:19`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[249.934921, "o", "2. **File System Permissions Hardening:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[249.935121, "o", "   - Set `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/` to read-only for Tomcat user to prevent future web shell drops `/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:1`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[249.93517, "o", "3. **Centralized Audit Logging:**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[249.935369, "o", "   - Configure rsyslog/fluentd to ship `/var/log/secure` logs off-host to prevent unmonitored log wipes `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`, `/disk/var/log/secure:213`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[249.935467, "o", "### Phase 4: Verification & Monitoring\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[249.935574, "o", "1. Verify no active processes or connections remain to `198.51.100.167` `/disk/var/log/secure:213`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[249.935702, "o", "2. Run integrity scan on `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys` `/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:2` and `/var/spool/cron/` `/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[249.935805, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[249.935888, "o", "3. Confirm Tomcat service functions correctly with upgraded `struts2-core.jar` `/disk/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[249.93653, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@ec2bee70e55c:/app# "]
[262.908183, "i", "ls -la /app\n"]
